+# Ext 3010: prefill attention kernel for the quantized-cache two-pass path (chunks of >= _pattn_min_q rows):
+# "pattn" (CUDA, default) or "triton". Read once at import; any other value is an error. The module attribute
+# `prefill_attn` may be reassigned at runtime (A/B harnesses)
